ENTITY RA1
QUALIFY RA1 kind relation
QUALIFY RA1 type tau_R
RTYPE RA1 tau_A tau_A
QUALIFY RA1 functional true

EDGE A1 RA1 A2 1

EDGE A2 RA1 A3 1

EDGE A3 RA1 A4 1

EDGE A4 RA1 A5 1

EDGE A5 RA1 A6 1

EDGE A6 RA1 A7 1

ENTITY U5
QUALIFY U5 kind stream
QUALIFY U5 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U5 I0 A1V3
AT U5 I1 A2V2
AT U5 I2 A3V1

ENTITY U6
QUALIFY U6 kind stream
QUALIFY U6 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U6 I0 A2V1
AT U6 I1 A3V7
AT U6 I2 A4V6

ENTITY U7
QUALIFY U7 kind stream
QUALIFY U7 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U7 I0 A3V2
AT U7 I1 A4V1

ENTITY T3
QUALIFY T3 kind task
QUALIFY T3 context CX3
QUALIFY T3 input U5
QUALIFY T3 input U6
QUALIFY T3 input U7

UNKNOWN_AT T3 X3 U7 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

CONSTRAINT COMPONENT_RELATION C3A U7 1 RA1
QUALIFY T3 constraint C3A

CONSTRAINT COMPONENT_RELATION C3V U7 2 RVdown
QUALIFY T3 constraint C3V
